    <title>Problems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>Problem</th><th>Clinical status</th><th>Verification</th><th>Code</th><th>Provenance</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Memory loss over about two years, worse in the past six months, with repeated questions, missed appointments and bills, and getting lost twice while driving in familiar streets, reported by him and his care partner; cause to be found</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>R41.3</td><td>S — Synthetic presenting problem anchored to his documented Alzheimer&apos;s disease; resolved into the diagnosis at the third visit. Not a claim about his real symptoms at that age.</td>
